{"title":"202512 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch二级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"Scratch","level":2,"yearmonth":"202512","year":"2025","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫和小狗初始位置如下图所示，点击绿旗后会发生什么？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688144122465.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688144182271.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688144232223.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"小猫和小狗都向右移动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"小猫向右移动到右边缘，小狗向左移动到左边缘"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"小猫和小狗都向左移动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"小猫和小狗移动10步后停止"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"小猫面向右（90度），小狗面向左（-90度），“重复执行” 是无限循环，所以小猫向右、小狗向左持续移动。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，运行下列程序后，舞台上能看到？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688145683556.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688145836414.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688145892272.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688145956935.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688146014328.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"每次循环包含两次移动和两次右转：移动100步（长边）→ 右转90度 → 移动50步（短边）→ 右转90度。重复4次后，形成一个长方形。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小鸭子碰到红色区域就变小，碰到蓝色区域就变大，下列程序正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688146699611.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688146816470.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688146909445.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688146977979.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688147023648.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"选项A能正确根据碰到不同颜色区域做出大小变化的反应。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"背景上绘制了一个红色圆圈，小猫碰到红色会说 “碰到红色啦”，应该使用下列哪个选项的积木？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688151799131.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688151925081.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688151971590.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688152045358.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688152107061.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"“碰到颜色” 可检测指定颜色，其他选项分别检测鼠标、舞台边缘或按键。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"大象能左右移动，碰到香蕉会说“我碰到啦”，碰到边缘能反弹，程序空白处应依次填入的积木是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688152875299.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688152948696.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688153069969.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688153125778.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688153185135.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688153232515.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"碰到香蕉时，说 “我碰到啦”1 秒，然后回到舞台中心；当大象碰到舞台左右边缘时，自动反弹（改变移动方向）。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"哪吒踢毽子，当按下键盘上的 “空格” 键时，毽子会飞起来，应该使用下列哪个选项的积木作为触发条件？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688154113601.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688154264389.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688154321796.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688154371461.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688154435439.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"属于侦测模块中的按键检测，用于响应键盘输入。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下面图形排列规律，“?”处图形是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688155676625.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688155784086.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688155837414.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688155892211.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688155956050.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"每3个图形循环一次，第7项对应第1项","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"鸡蛋和煎锅角色初始位置如下图所示，煎锅中心点位置为（0,0），下列哪个程序能够实现鸡蛋移到煎锅上面，保持原样，实现“煎鸡蛋”的效果？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688159248883.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688159423142.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688159483390.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688159574811.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688159669125.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"考察“层”的关系和“亮度特效”的数值效果。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"两个角色初始位置如下图所示，初始方向都为面向90方向，点击绿旗，下列哪个选项的程序能够让他们“面对面”？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688160609894.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688160706288.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688160762564.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688160824207.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688160891422.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688160945723.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688161009342.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688161068791.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688161124861.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"考察对软件和初始角色的熟悉程度，面向90度和-90度的效果。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个程序可以让小鱼捉到小河豚时说：“抓到你了！”，没抓到的时候说：“嘘……”？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688162559308.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688162742909.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688162816659.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688162867279.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688162914156.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"首先程序中必须重复判断，其次“抓到”和“没抓到”是两个互斥的过程，结果是不同的。A选项在循环中顺序执行，因此选择C。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"两位同学在校门口相遇，当按下a键，女生说：“早上好”，当按下p键，女生说；“明天见”。下列哪个选项的程序能够实现这个功能？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688164054300.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688164188234.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688164247878.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688164295173.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688164351022.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"重复执行不要忘记，按下a键和p键的内容搭配不要混淆。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"井深90步，小蜗牛初始位置在井底，每往上爬10步，往下滑2步，要想使小蜗牛爬出井口吃到苹果，红框处应该填入几？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688164721831.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688164771499.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"8"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"9"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"10"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"11"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"根据题意，先留出最后10步，剩下的80步按照走10步退2步的规律，一共需要执行10次，因此n=10。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫角色运行下列程序，说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688166806631.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688166855663.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"小猫静止不动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"小猫一直滑行，停不下来"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"小猫碰到篮球会停止不动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"小猫滑行一次，不管碰到还是没有碰到篮球，都会停下来"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"根据程序，只有当碰到“篮球”才会停止“瞬移”动作，因此最终停在“篮球”上。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"蜻蜓初始位置如下图所示，运行下列程序，正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688167478519.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688167515284.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"蜻蜓不断移到随机位置"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"蜻蜓不动，一直停在白色区域"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"蜻蜓落到浅黄色区域"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"蜻蜓消失"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"根据程序用意，只有当停在白色区域时，才会停止“瞬移”动作，因此选B。","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小女孩有四个造型，运行下列程序后，用鼠标点击一次小女孩，会切换成哪个造型？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688168333162.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17688168402260.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"batter-a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"batter-b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"batter-c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"batter-d"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"点击小女孩，相当于小女孩碰到鼠标指针并且按下鼠标键这个条件成立，小女孩最后切换为batter-a。","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小红和小蓝参加了跑步比赛，如果她俩同时碰到红线，就是并列第一，下列哪个选项不能判断两人是否并列第一？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688169241644.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688169361500.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688169426485.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688172196359.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688172253301.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"判断“并列第一”需要同时判断两个条件都成立，因此B选项不正确。","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项的程序不能实现如下图所示的效果？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688172944637.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688173126019.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688173173486.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688173232659.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688173282148.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"连接指令中的“和”不能被显示出来，是逻辑相连的含义，因此选择A。","auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项的程序，无法做到两个音乐同时播放？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688174104431.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688174267769.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688174344616.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688174402967.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688174473317.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"A选项音乐顺序播放。","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"“？”处应填什么样的图形？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688175103365.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688175294995.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688175365175.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688175412935.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688175478400.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"第一行和第二行中的最右边的完整图形是这样变来的：将最左边的半个图形，往右平移到中间图形位置，然后再去掉两个图形的重合部分。","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下列数字规律，横线处应填写？（ ）"},{"t":"15、11、13、13、11、15、9、17、7、____、____、21、3"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"19 5"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"19 7"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"11 5"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"11 7"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"一个数隔一个数找规律。","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，初始位置在舞台中心，初始方向是面向90，按下一次空格键，舞台上能看到？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17688176665569.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688176775382.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688176835042.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688176886651.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17688176934156.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"阅读代码可知，